{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using the scvi_n200 encoder for singleprofile tasks, comparing its performance to the pca_n2000 encoder (config_002). Validation accuracy of 0.5203 and F1 of 0.4982 suggest scvi_n200 outperforms pca_n2000 in this setup, but the performance remains lower than the multimodal baseline (config_016). Uncertainty persists about whether encoder choice alone drives performance differences or if other factors like modality integration contribute, as no direct comparisons with alternative single-modality configurations were made."
}

